# The build context of packaging/docker/Dockerfile, which is the top of
# the repository: everything but the history, build directories, and what
# autoreconf makes again in the image. config.status stays visible, so
# that the Dockerfile can refuse a tree configured in place.
.git
build*
autom4te.cache
aclocal.m4
configure
configure~
config.h.in
config.h.in~
**/Makefile.in
